      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAYDEN'S MILK (5) jumped well to win over the 342m at Angle Park two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing second at this track last start. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from seven attempts. Winning claims. BINNAWAY WIZARD (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.75 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 19.63 beating Toby Keeping. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. One of the leading chances again. VODKA SUNRISE (7) is in consistent form, jumping from this same box when a 3.5 lengths third in a Grade 2/3 at Broken Hill and making it back to back minors. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. AMRON TIGER (2) should be thereabouts.",
